cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data it produced, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "predictive-prewarming-edge-serverless"
abstract: >-
  Open, reproducible benchmarking harness comparing an always-on
  container deployment against reactive and predictively pre-warmed
  (EWMA, last-gap, moving-average, fixed-schedule) on-demand serverless
  deployments of an identical real-time telemetry-ingestion service,
  with matched-trial statistical analysis and a measured cost-latency
  model.
authors:
